    <Major></Major>
    <Description>The combo is a fast, high-pressure string designed to overwhelm opponents with speed and precision. The combo finishes with a charged special attack, slamming the opponent back to the ground for maximum damage. Skilled players can extend the combo with wall bounces or meter burns, making it a deadly tool for aggressive play. A side dash cancel is used to close distance or bait a reaction, allowing for a mix-up between continued attacks or a charged strike. Another dash forward keeps up the aggression, chaining into a finisher move that either knocks the opponent away or sets up an air juggle if timed correctly. The seamless blend of click-based attacks and dashes ensures relentless pressure, making it difficult for the opponent to regain control.</Description>
